{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-action--5","attack-condition--1","attack-condition--2","attack-condition--3","instance--de76b67a-16ff-51b2-8520-0b8411f66ca3","instance--6b86637a-4491-50fb-9839-e7e3e55c53dc","instance--53b8bcce-1f02-5272-8958-2d52476eab18","instance--1a85a17c-e234-5b95-a281-0c96aa9986d3","instance--c23d65ff-7d54-5217-bdcd-a716a046ec4a","software--1","url--1","software--2","file--1","instance--93a75dd4-72a9-572c-aecd-e25b18c4b9c7","instance--dadca443-3500-5f04-8729-4777f168a65f","instance--353aa620-4c8a-5471-be46-d26f6b69742f","instance--384798bd-a84b-5feb-8d38-7f9d0a087f11","instance--3aaedd0d-9fff-581d-be5f-4d397694adf4","instance--36d3365f-6f58-5a47-a23e-17ca4300a1b0","instance--503dee10-06da-53db-9fd3-29c663555d3e","instance--7e8c9301-c3f8-55e9-8894-e81f1b6203d9","instance--da64db7b-72ea-5afe-9c80-032eb029e0eb","instance--fb1118d0-336c-5935-b063-da32890e1042","instance--7c025cd6-e3a7-568c-b58e-f2f08fe43e1d","instance--c92680fa-6a01-59b3-b1b7-867efe2a4db8","instance--bb170793-a0b8-5a22-b9f9-5dff26468abb","instance--e6439bc0-f06b-5307-8fe8-0018002dfdea","instance--0e0aefbc-132c-5535-9d21-08a6439d6b20","instance--57744d96-f386-5ec7-aeae-ca8155ad2e09"],"properties":[["name","Symbol Electron wallet remote code execution vulnerability exploit flow"],["description","Vulnerability in Electron-based Application: Unintentionally Giving Malicious Code Room to Run"],["scope","incident"],["author",[["name","CertiK"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","medium.com"],["url","https://medium.com/certik/vulnerability-in-electron-based-application-unintentionally-giving-malicious-code-room-to-run-e2e1447d01b8"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Execute arbitrary JavaScript in app"],["description","In order to take advantage of the enabled Node.js, an attacker would need to find a way to execute arbitrary Javascript in the application. This can often be achieved by exploiting the XSS (Cross Site Scripting) vulnerability, or a user unknowingly loads a remote web page embedded with Javascript that a hacker controls from within the Electron application."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1189"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Load infected page in wallet"],["description","Once the user clicks a link in the news feed, the application will navigate away from the wallet interface and loads the external website (Github, in this case) inside the current window."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1189"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Escalate JavaScript to remote code execution"],["description","With set to true and Node.js enabled, arbitrary javascript execution can be escalated to remote code execution with the help of the \"child_process\" module."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1059.007"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Trigger system command via button click"],["description","After the user visits the infected page and clicks the \u201cClose\u201d button, the calculator will open on the user\u2019s computer."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1204.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Execute system command automatically"],["description","In reality, an attacker may host a malicious script that triggers the system command execution automatically and inconspicuously when users visit the page."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1059.007"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","Based on the build.js configuration file, we learn that if the application runs on the Windows operating system, Node.js will be enabled."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instanc